1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ingeborg Bengtsdotter bjälke=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Bengt Larsson bjälke från Västergötland and Katarina Staffansdotter (Ulv)
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ingeborg Bengtsdotter bjälke från Västergötland, Daughter of Bengt Larsson (bjälke) and his second wife Katarina Staffansdotter (Ulv). First Marriage: Bengt Tomasson (Pipa) (d. before 1442). He was a well-documented squire who o
2 CONC riginally held the massive family properties of Bystad (in Asker, Närke). When Bengt Pipa died, Ingeborg was left as a relatively young, highly wealthy widow in control of his properties. She Second Marriage (ca. 1442): Lars Sigge
2 CONC sson "den äldre" (Sparre). When Lars Siggesson married her, he did so specifically as the "widow of Bengt Tomasson (Pipa).
2 CONT
