2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tre_rosor Three roses, by Adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 6'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jöns Knutsson''' (son of Knut Jonsson Tab. 3 ). National Council. Married 1st before 1472 to Ingegerd, daughter of the knight and Norwegian councilor Erik Samundsson (Skanke) and Estrid Nilsdotter (Välingeätten). '''Married 2nd
2 CONC  to Arffrydh, daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman Åke Jänsson ( Svarte Skåning ) and Metchild Clausdotter ( Plata ). Married 3rd to Ermegard Fickesdotter, daughter of Ficke Bylow and Hebbla Albrechtsdotter ( Bydelsbach ) 
2 CONC (who remarried the lawman Magnus Bengtsson ( Night and Day )).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Estrid.''' Married to Johan Bese .
2 CONT * 1. '''Ture Jönssson''' Knight, councillor, lawman and master of the court. Married before 1498 to Anna Johansdotter, daughter of the knight and councilor Johan Christiernsson ( Vasa ) and Brita Tordsdotter ( Bonde ). The wife In
2 CONC geborg Engelbrechtsdotter is mentioned as Mr. Tures' concubine and she was the mother of the Riksdag and lawman in Östergötland Jacob Tursson and Elin Tursdotter.
2 CONT * 1. '''Erik Jönsson.''' Married to his stepmother Ermegard Fickesdotter daughter Margareta Månsdotter ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 2. '''Arfrid Jönsdotter.''' Married to her stepmother's Ermegard Fickesdotter son Johan Månsson ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 3. '''Agnes Jönsdotter.''' Died unmarried
