2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sten Jönsson Bese. Sten Gönsson Bese was owner of Hyriksäter estate in Värna parish, Sweden. He served as circuit judge in Bankekind jurisdictional district (Östergötland). Was giving as morning gift 1 Oct 1425 Hårketorp a
2 CONC nd several estates in Hällestad and Risinge parish in Östergötland.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Känd 1345-92. Kristina fick 1425-10-01 Hårketorp m fl gårdar i Hällerstads och Risinge socknar i norra Östergötland i morgongåva.
