2 CONT
2 CONT =[https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cecilia_Haraldsdotter_(Gren) Cecilia Haraldsdotter (Gren), Swedish  Nobility, by Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Cecilia Haraldsdotter (Gren) , year of birth and death unknown (lived yet 1465), was a Swedish nobleman . She was the daughter of Harald Stensson Gren and Sigrid Tomasdotter van Vitzen and niece of the Magnus Gren National Council
2 CONC  . She also became the grandmother of Gustav Vasa .
2 CONT
2 CONT Cecilia Haraldsdotter married on July 5, 1441 with the national council Eskil Isaksson Banér . She then received Venngarn's "farm and estate" with several subordinate farms (including Stora Brännbo ) in her husband's morning gift 
2 CONC . In the gift letter, two of the most powerful men of the time, Karl Knutsson (Bonde) and Bengt Jönsson (Oxenstierna) , appear as further men . 
2 CONT
