1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isak Isakson oli asemies ja ritari vuosina 1408 – 1414 sekä Upplannin kihlakunnantuomari vuonna 1424.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Isak Isaksson Baner==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Isak Isaksson, (son of Isak Björnsson), armed men 1398–1429-04-00.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married before 1398-05-22 with Märeta Siggesdotter, dead about 1452, daughter of the gunman Sigge Brun, to Röklinge (night and day in the cross) and his 1st wife Birgitta Nilsdotter (2 tips from above).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Brita Isaksdotter. Married 1: o 1420-10-21 with Erik Karlsson (3 bear frames). Married 2: o with the gunman and chieftain in Hammarkind Birger Nilsson (sparre) to Fyllingarum.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Eskil Isaksson. Knights and national council. Death 1488. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Descendants==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Grandchildren: Sigrid Eskilsdotter (Banér), Knut Eskilsson
2 CONT * Great grandchildren: Christina Gyllenstierna, Cecilia Månsdotter, Dordi Knutsdotter Banér
2 CONT
