2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ingemar+Pellesson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_31551&tab=post SDHK no: 31551]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1485 January 18, Place of issue: Crowd''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lindorm Björnsson, lawman in Västergötland , awards the well-to-do man Jöns Knutsson on behalf of his wife (Ermegard Bulow) the farm Botilsäter (Botilsäters sn) in Näs hd in Värmland and forecloses on Ingemar Pellesson, who presen
2 CONC ted a mortgage deed. Jöns Knutsson had presented before the court the judgment letters from 1417 (SDHK no. 19003 ) and 1442 (SDHK no. 24197 ) as well as a receipt letter (SDHK no. 24183 ), which letters proved that Mr. Lars Ulfsso
2 CONC n sold his farm. The issuer seals.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources,''' Post-medieval copies:  Lars Eriksson Sparre's copy book, hs B 16, fol. 30r-v, National Archives (SE/RA/0202) image ; prints of B 16 texts, Sv. Dipl. Literature and commentary, Compare SDHK no. 32012 and see DMS, V
2 CONC ärmland 7, p. 541.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ingemar+Pellesson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_32012&tab=post#tab SDHK no: 32012]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating:  1488 February 17, Place of issue: Arboga'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Armsman Ingemar Pellesson announces that the land "Röntegen" that he mistakenly owned rightfully belongs to the well-to-do man Jöns Knutsson and has been located on his farm Botilsäter. That is why he now leases the land to him. T
2 CONC he letter issuer seals together with Lindorm Björnson, lawman in Västergötland, Olof Björnson, lawman in Värmland, and Hans Svensson, district chief in Vartofta hd.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval copies:  Lars Eriksson Sparre's copy book, hs B 16, fol. 114v, no. 175, National Archives (SE/RA/0202) image ; prints of B 16 texts, Sv. Dipl. Literature and commentary, Compare SDHK no. 31551 and se
2 CONC e DMS, Värmland 7, p. 541.
2 CONT
