2 CONT * Older Swedish salvation genealogy. Published by the Knights House Board. (ASF). Hans Gillingstam Jan Raneke, Swedish medieval weapon.
2 CONT * Äldre svenska frälsesläkter, by Folke Wernstedt, 1965
