1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slaweka
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skuttunge_kyrka
2 CONT
2 CONT This family originated at Schlawkewitz on the island of Rügen and was prosperous there.  Branches settled in Denmark.  The Swedish representation begins with Claus Slaweka "gamble Slawika" (i.e. the old Slawika), known 1367-1378, 
2 CONC married N. N. Matsdotter (Gillbergaätten). 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had a son Claus Slaweka "the elder", known 1409-1430, married Märta Ingemundsdotter (vase).  Their son Claus Slaweka "the younger", known 143, died about 1440, married Bengta Johansdotter (Schack af Skylvalla) and had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
