2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ulfsax_nr_107#TAB_2 '''Anund Jönsson, to Byerum'''] (in Åby parish, Kalm.?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in 1520, died before 1526. Married before 1514-01-18 with Carin Hansdotter in her 1st marriage (married 2 o'clock before 1526 with chieftain Harald Knutsson ( Soop ), dead 1530. Married 3: o before 1536 with the teamman in V
2 CONC ästergötland Olof Pedersson to Stora Bjurum, who received a letter of rescues and wrestling from 1541-07-29 with a sculpted eagle foot in the shield and on the helmet, lived in 1554), died before 1554-07-25, when the inheritance w
2 CONC as executed after her at Stora Bjurum, daughter of the knight, the council and the teamman at Närke Hans Åkesson ( Tott ) and Kerstin Eriksdotter ( Gyllenstierna of Lundholm ).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Kerstin Anundsdotter , lived 1554-07-25 at the turn of the century. Married 1533-08-03 at Nyköping Castle with Sten Bengtsson ( backing wolf ) to Stäflö in Åby parish Kalmar County. In 1556 she moved to Germany with German Jöran P
2 CONC iper
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ulfsax_nr_107#TAB_2
2 CONT
