2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Jöns Knutsson (Tre rosor) and Alfrid Åkesdotter (Svarte Skåning)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tre_rosor Three Roses, by Adelsvapen]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 6'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Jöns Knutsson (son of Knut Jonsson Tab. 3 ). National Council. Married 1st before 1472 to Ingegerd, daughter of the knight and Norwegian councilor Erik Samundsson (Skanke) and Estrid Nilsdotter (Välingeätten). Married 2nd to Arffr
2 CONC ydh, daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman Åke Jänsson ( Svarte Skåning ) and Metchild Clausdotter ( Plata ). Married 3rd to Ermegard Fickesdotter, daughter of Ficke Bylow and Hebbla Albrechtsdotter ( Bydelsbach ) (who rema
2 CONC rried the lawman Magnus Bengtsson ( Night and Day )).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Estrid'''. Married to Johan Bese .
2 CONT * 1. '''Ture Jönssson,''' Knight, councillor, lawman and master of the court. Married before 1498 to Anna Johansdotter, daughter of the knight and councilor Johan Christiernsson ( Vasa ) and Brita Tordsdotter ( Bonde ). The wife I
2 CONC ngeborg Engelbrechtsdotter is mentioned as Mr. Tures' concubine and she was the mother of the Riksdag and lawman in Östergötland Jacob Tursson and Elin Tursdotter.
2 CONT * 1. '''Erik Jönsson.''' Married to her stepmother Ermegard Fickesdotter daughter Margareta Månsdotter ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 2. '''Arfrid Jönsdotter.''' Married to his stepmother's Ermegard Fickesdotter son Johan Månsson ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 3. '''Agnes Jönsdotter.''' Died unmarried
2 CONT
