2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Germund Larsson (lilja) and Ingeborg Ragvaldsdotter 
2 CONT * Birgitta Germundsdotter, who in 1463 made her will and then donated Julita monastery, where she chose her camp town, her estate Styrista and two crofts in Lännäs' parish, in Närke, as well as died 1484-07-28, daughter of the dis
2 CONC trict chief in Austrian Germund Larsson (lily) to Fjällskäfte and his wife Ingeborg.
