2 CONT *[http://www.lennheden.com/genealogi/gunnar/000/0001/183.htm Lennheden Geneology]
2 CONT *[https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Swedish_noble_families Kagg is in the List of Noble Families]
2 CONT *[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svenske_nr_258 Svenske nr 258 Tab 4, by Adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
