1 NAME Tore /Byting/ till Stola
2 GIVN Tore
2 SURN Byting
2 NSFX till Stola
2 _MARNM Byting
2 NICK Tore
2 NICK Pyting?
2 NICK Vapnare Tore
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1390
2 PLAC Stola Herrgård i Strö socken
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västra Götalands län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1448
2 PLAC Stola Herrgård i Strö socken
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västra Götaland County
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Väpnare n. 1416-39
1 TITL Væpner
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Væpner Tore Byting, till Stola=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Thore Byting was born in ca. 1390 Stola. He died in Stola pa Kallandsay i Veneren, dod etter 1448.. 
2 CONT * Tore Byting was a Swedish squire who is mentioned in contemporary sources between 1416 and 1437–1439. He is believed to have been lord of the manor of Stola in Västergötland , which was held by his widow Holmfrid Jonsdotter in 1
2 CONC 478. It is disputed which coat of arms Tore Byting carried, but it has been assumed to represent an inverted mussel shell. However, a surviving 16th-century drawing of his seal shows a difficult-to-interpret motif that has been de
2 CONC scribed as "three objects, similar to hockey sticks, set in a pole-wise manner" ( Beerståhl ). Byting is above all known as the ancestor of a number of Swedish nobility . A first compilation of his descendants was made in 1579 and
2 CONC  is kept in the National Archives . It has since been published in printed form in 1885 (in the Swedish Autografsällskapets journal ) and 1958 (in Släkt och Hävd ).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He married '''Holmfrid Jonsdatter.''' Thore was born in Bodde 1416 i Sverige. Holmfrid Jonsdatter [Parents] died in Stola pa Kallandsay i Veneren. She married Thore Byting.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =They had the following children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Ingrid Thoresdatter Bytting.''' Married Oluf Trulsson Håberg 
2 CONT * '''Ingegjerd Thoresdatter Bytting.'''
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Thoresdatter Byting was born in 1425.''' Married  Sven Johansson Halv Lilja.
2 CONT * '''Karin Thoresdatter Byting.''' Married  Klaus Christensson Ribbing (Halvmåne) 
2 CONT * '''Byting Olofsson Byting,'''
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Byting.'''
2 CONT * '''Hebla Bytting.'''
2 CONT * '''Anna Bytting.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =The Swedish Diplomatarium's Main Catalog of Medieval Letters=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Broka&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=7&postid=sdhk_26085&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 26085''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1452 April 6'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Stole''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Holmfrid Johansdotter, Tore Byting's widow , authorizes Jöns Broka to collect from Mr. Åke Jönsson, knight and courtier at Ringstaholm, the money that her husband lent him.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Bishop Bengt in Skara seals when the issuer lacks a seal. Original:  Or. paperboard. RA 0102
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Broka&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=7&postid=sdhk_26085&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 26085''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1452 April 6'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Stole'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Holmfrid Johansdotter, Tore Byting's widow , authorizes Jöns Broka to collect from Mr. Åke Jönsson, knight and courtier at Ringstaholm, the money that her husband lent him.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bishop Bengt in Skara seals when the issuer lacks a seal.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources: Original:  Or. paperboard. RA 0102'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Tore+Byting&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_27833&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 27833''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1461 September 8'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Crowd''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archdeacon Johannes, dean Petrus and the entire chapter in Skara judge in the dispute between Mr. Åke Jönsson, knight, and wife Homfrid in "Stordha", Tore Byting's widow, regarding "Korsgardhen" in Qwalden (Kålland) and ij andr
2 CONC a gardha in Baltak in Wartopta hæradh ”; the target was usury.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Language: Swedish,  Medieval copies:  copy paper. RA 0102, Medieval regest/notice:  C 25 fol. 6v RA 0301
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Byting&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=15&postid=sdhk_30430&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 30430''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1478 July 25'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Stole''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Humfridh" Jonsdotter , Byting's widow in "Stordhom" (Stola i Strö sn, Kållands hd, Västergötland), gives with the consent of her son Byting a part in a meadow by Aspenäs ödetorp to Otterstad's priest board.
2 CONT
2 CONT The issuer seals together with Sten, parish priest in Sunnersberg.'''
2 CONT
