1 NAME Nils Claesson /Ekeblad/
2 GIVN Nils Claesson
2 SURN Ekeblad
2 _MARNM Ekeblad
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
