1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Botil Knutsdotter (Tre rosor)==
2 CONT
2 CONT (TAB 8)
2 CONT
2 CONT Botil Knutsdotter, daughter of the knight and riksråded Knut Alfsson ( Three roses ) and Görvel Eriksdotter ( Gyllenstierna )
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father Nilsson (son of Nils Fadersson Tab. 7 ). Married after 1509 with 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Görvel Father's daughter. Died 1605. Married 1532 with Peter Nilsson ( Grip , younger eater)
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Sparre_av_Hjulsta_och_%C3%84ngs%C3%B6 Sparre Geneology]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Parents==
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Alfsson (son of Knut Jonsson Tab. 4 ). Knight. Swedish and Norwegian councils. Married 1488 with Görvel Eriksdotter, daughter of the knight, the council and the lawyer Erik Eriksson ( Gyllenstierna ) and Christina Karlsdotter
2 CONC  ( Bonde ). Omgift by 1499 with Mette Iversdatter, daughter of the knight Iver Jenssen ( Dyre ) and Christina Persdotter (Oxe) who later got married to the Swedish state chief Svante Nilsson ( Sture
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Botil Knutsdotter. Married to Father Nilsson ( Sparre of Hjulsta and Ängsö )'''
2 CONT * 1. Karl Knutsson
2 CONT * 1. Erik Knutsson. Married to Margareta Eriksdotter daughter of Erik Karlsson ( Vaasa ) and Anna Karlsdotter ( Vinstorpaätten ), later married to the Saxon countryman Berend von Melen
