2 CONT ==Bengt Eales (winged arrow) Wikipedia==
2 CONT
2 CONT He is mentioned in Swedish Diplomatariums Huvudkartotek as Omnibus Christi Fidelibus presents Inspecturis, Benedict Eleph son Salutem in Domino Sempiternam propane hominumLabilem memoriam, when in a proclamation in February in 129
2 CONC 3 Announces that forests and land have been passed on to ' Fröknarna ' Ingeborg and Margaret as the inheritance of their father, the issuer's father-in-law, with the consent of the issuer's wife Katarina and her sister Birgitta. W
2 CONC itnesses are Lars Boberg, Rörik Birger'S son and Algot Jonsson, who also together with the issuer are sigillanter.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Bengt Eales (winged arrow) Wikipedia - https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengt_Elofsson_(vingad_pil)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Mentioned in 1293, SDHC No. 1590, Dating: February 12, 23==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Content'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengt Elofsson announces that 1 farm in "... shoehouse" with country dweller, 1 farm in "alcauid", 1 farmyard in "tubbæthorpe", 1/2 salmon fishing next to "thrasnes", the 2 forests "tansersscogh" and "alxersscogh" and 1 mill in "h
2 CONC eriælungum" accrued to the "seedlings" Ingeborg and Margareta as heritage of their father, the father-in-law of the issuer, with the consent of the issuer's wife Katarina and her sister Birgitta. The witnesses are Lars Boberg, Rör
2 CONC ik Birgersson and Algot Jonsson, who, together with the issuer, are sailors.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/1590.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Brorson to Birger Earl. Married (ESFs 12, 23, 26, 27).
