1 NAME Germund /Larsson (lilja)/
2 GIVN Germund
2 _MARNM Larsson (lilja)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1400
2 PLAC Floda, Södermanland, Sweden
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 29 SEP 1459
2 PLAC Södermanland, Sweden
2 ADDR
1 OCCU landshövdingen i Öster Rekarne, Häradshövding i Österrekarne, Häradshövding
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Germund Larsson (upright lily)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married Ingeborg Ragvaldsdotter 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =The Swedish Diplomatarium's Main Catalog of Medieval Letters=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Germund+Larsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=4&postid=sdhk_19818&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 19818''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1422 March 15'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003276594772&photo_id=6000000191711982910&position=1 '''Germund Larsson (upright lily) in "Fielskæpte" (Fjällskäfte) pledges 60 marks of English money to prior Jak
2 CONC ob and the brothers in Eskilstuna 1/2 markland of land in "Adhesögha" (Ånsöga) in Eskilstuna (now Klosters) parish.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The issuer, Mr. Nils Ragvaldsson, dean of Strängnäs, Ingevald Larsson in Släthammar (now Stenhammar in Flen parish) and Jöns Birgersson in Hugelsta (Klosters parish) seal.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources: Original:  Or. perg. RA 0101  images, Post-medieval transcripts:  Hadorph: IE 74 p. 89 f; Peringskiöld: E 57 (reg); Örnhielm: XI p. 286. SEAL 3 and 1 strip.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Germund+Larsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=6&postid=sdhk_39862&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 39862''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1423 without day'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Strangnäs''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Issuer: Siblings Ingevald Larsson, Cecilia Larsdotter and Gudmund Larsson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings Ingevald Larsson, Cecilia Larsdotter and Gudmund (wrong for Germund?) Larsson issues a letter concerning the estate of his mother, whereby Ingevald had received 1/2 land in "Slätthamar" (Stone Hammer) in Flen parish, O
2 CONC ppunda county, 7 öre in Botorp in Hällestad parish, 1 piece of land in Västerby and 1 eel fishery, located at "gryta gööl" (Grytgöl?) in the aforementioned parish. Cecilia had received 7 öre in Hagnesta in Eskilstuna (Klosters) pa
2 CONC rish, Österrekarne. Gudmund had received 17 herds in Lida in Flen parish, 7 öre in Brånsta in Anneberg parish, Örebro county, in Borringe 2 eighths in Boberg county, 1 öre in Hovra in Helgona parish, Rönö county, 4 pennies in "ome
2 CONC "(?) in Råby parish, 2 herb gardens in Ene in Stigtomta parish and 1(?) herb garden in Tibble. Herr Birger Stensson, archdeacon of Strängnäs, and Klas van der Lippen witness and sign.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval regest/notice:  List of Rosenhane's estate, Kammarkollegiet subject collection, vol. 172 (or A 3) Rosenhane, f. 8r, RA, Photocopy:  Diplomatariat
2 CONT * '''Literature and commentary''' Listed under the heading "Slätthamar's goods letter". Presumably same letter as SDHK No. 20058 (of 14230411); cf. also SDHK No. 20057 (of 14230411).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Germund+Larsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=8&postid=sdhk_20058&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 20058''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1423 April 11'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Strangnäs''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ingevald Larsson, Cecilia Larsdotter and Germund Larsson transfer their mother's property, whereby the first mentioned gets land in "Slæthammar" (now Stenhammar) in Flen parish, in Botorp in Hällestad parish as well as their mo
2 CONC ther's property in Västerby and an eel fishery in Grytgöl in the said parish. Cecilia gets land in Hagnesta in Eskilstuna parish and Germund gets land in Lida in Flens parish, in Brunstorp in Axbergs parish in Örebro, in Borringe 
2 CONC in Älvestads parish, in Hovra in Helgona parish, in "Lionne" in Råby parish, in Tärnö in " Steghatopta" (Husby sn) ​​and in Tybble (Malms sn).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Original:  Or. perg. UUB: Rosenh. Photocopy:  DK
2 CONT * '''Literature and commentary,''' See DMS, Södermanland 2:2, pp. 131, 169 and 233, and 2:5, pp. 90 and 92.
2 CONT Presumably same letter as SDHK No. 39862 (of 14230000); cf. also SDHK No. 20057 (of 14230411) and SDHK No. 19712 .
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Germund+Larsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=17&postid=sdhk_24549&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 24549''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1444 June 12'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Germund Larsson transfers Anders Ernolfsson land in Harby in Kjula parish in Österrekarne to land in Kalsta in Floda parish in Oppunda.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:'''  Original:  Or. perg. RA 0101  images, Post-medieval transcripts:  Brocman: IV Misc. 49:30
2 CONT * '''Literature and commentary,''' About Germund Larsson see S. Ljung in PHT 1963, pp. 41-53. Ang. Kalsta see DMS, Södermanland 2:5, p. 110 f.
