1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Sigfrid Preston from England, who in 1568 was a ship's captain in Swedish service.
2 CONT
2 CONT Excerpts from sources provided by Bo Persson:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lannäs is recorded as Sefrid Engilsman's godz. Sigfrid Engelsman's real name was Geoffrey Preston. He was married to the previous owner, Ulf Henriksson's widow, Agneta Knutsdotter (Lillie, af Ökna). Preston was one of several Engl
2 CONC ishmen who, during Erik XIV's time, went into Swedish service, and he is mentioned in a couple of places in Gunnar Sjögren's biography of his stepdaughter, Helena Snakenborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sigfrid Preston''' från England, som i 1568 var skeppshövidsman i svensk tjänst.
2 CONT
2 CONT Utdrag ur källor förmedlade av Bo Persson:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lannäs upptas som Sefrid Engilsmans godz. Sigfrid Engelsman hette egentligen Geoffrey Preston. Denne var gift med den tidigare ägarens, Ulf Henriksson änka, Agneta Knutsdotter (Lillie, af Ökna). Preston var en av flera engelsmän s
2 CONC om under Erik XIV:s tid begav sig i svensk tjänst och han nämns på ett par ställen i Gunnar Sjögrens biografi över hans styvdotter, Helena Snakenborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=6441 John Keels was mentioned along with Sigrid Preston [SSNE 6059] in two letters from King Erik XIV of Sweden from March 1567. He hoped that these two men would be able to 
2 CONC help him gain control over Iceland. 
2 CONT * Swedish Riksarkiv, Titularregister till RR, card E01036, no.6, Öppna bref pro A.1566.
2 CONT * https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=6051 Sigfred Preston is noted as a captain of horse in Swedish service between 1569-1573. This is probably the same as Sigrid Preston mentioned in 1567 as someone King Erik X
2 CONC IV wanted to help bring Iceland under Swedish control as noted in letters from March 26 and 28 that year. 
2 CONT * G. Arteus, Till Militärstatens Förhistoria: Krig, professionalisering och social förändring under Vasasönernas regering (Stockholm, 1986), p.174; Swedish Riksarkiv, Titularregister till RR, card E01036, no.6, Öppna bref pro A.15
2 CONC 66. Thanks to Ardis Dreisbach for the Iceland reference.
2 CONT * Surname PRESTON, PRESTHON First name SIGFRED, SIGRID, GILBERT Title/rank CAPTAIN OF HORSE Nationality ENGLISH Service record. SWEDEN, Arrived 1567-04-05 Departed 1574-01-10, as CAPTAIN OF HORSE Capacity OFFICER, purpose MILITARY
