1 NAME Gustaf //
2 GIVN Gustaf
2 SURN af Sachsen-Enger-Westfahlen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 AUG 1570
2 PLAC Ekolsund
2 ADDR
3 STAE Uppland
3 CTRY Sweden
