2 CONT ==SDHK-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Pinnow&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=8&postid=sdhk_32254&tab=post#tab 32254]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dating: 1489 July 9
2 CONT * Place of issue: Uppsala 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgitta Arendsdotter (daughter of Arend Pinnow (bear head)), widow of Mr. Karl Magnusson (Eka family), sells with the consent of her heirs to Mr. Erik Andree, prebendate in Stockholm and parish priest in Solna, his plot in Norrma
2 CONC lm outside Stockholm for 60 land reda money; the plot will be subject to Helga five unders (sårs) prebenda in Stockholm's village church.
2 CONT
