2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vittsk%C3%B6vle_Castle
2 CONT Vittskövle Castle (Swedish: Vittskövle slott also spelt Widtsköfle slott) is a castle in Kristianstad Municipality, Scania, in southern Sweden. It is one of the best-preserved Renaissance castles in the Nordic countries, and was e
2 CONC rected by Jens Brahe in the 16th century as a defence structure. It is currently the private residence of the Stjernswärd family.
2 CONT
