2 CONC ldsdotter Puke. Married (2nd) at the earliest 1400 and at the latest 1406 to Elin Torstensdotter (oxpanna). (Died (was deceased) 1406.) Married (3rd) in 1408 to Elin Jönsdotter. Died at the earliest 1411.
