2 CONT * '''Dating: 1380 December 27, Place of issue; Bohus'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ragvald Erengislesson and Peter Ragvaldsson''' announce in an open letter that they pledge to the honest man Abraham Brodersson their entire property Fastarp in the parish of Tvååker in the fiefdom of Varberg with all appurtena
2 CONC nces, including land dwellers and mills, which since ancient times have been under this estate, for 20 merks in right loan. The property can be redeemed by the issuers and their heirs for 20 merks. The issuers seal.
