2 CONT
2 CONT Algot Brynjulfsen Lejon was born at Sweden. He married Kristina Tolvesdtr Sweden, daughter of Tolve Petersen. He married Margareta Ulfsdtr Lejon Sweden, daughter of Ulf Carlsen. He died after 1330. ( he was mentioned as already de
