1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Karl Sigtryggsson Boberg==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Sigtrygg Bengtsson (Boberg) and Kristina Magnusdotter Folkunga 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Pope Innocent (IV) to the bishop of Linköping with permission for Karl "Sistryggsson" and '''Helena Petersdotter''' to marry each other despite kinship in the fourth paragraph, as King Valdemar and Birger earl asked for
2 CONC  this in view of the benefits the marriage would mean for the kingdom. Perugia October 22, 1252.
2 CONT
