2 CONT Notes  •Knight; member of the royal council; mentioned between 1315-1357; was previously married to Katarina Gudmarsdotter (Ulvåsaätten) from before 22 Feb 1341 and until after 1 May 1344. (ÄSF, vol. I.1, p. 3)
