1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Is mentioned first in 1293 and then called domina, so she probably was already married to Councilllor and Knight Magnus Gregersson, with whom she was safely married 1295 Ingegerd did as a widow her will in 1326 and
2 CONC  chose the grave of the man in Sigtuna Dominican monastery. Alive yet February 16, 1328 but was dead in 1330. Married before November 4, 1295 with the previous analyzes.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Levde ännu 16/2 1328. Nämns första gången 1293 och kallas då Domina, varför hon troligen var gift med Magnus. År 1326 var hon änka och skrev då sitt testamente och valde sin grav hos sin man i Sigtuna dominikankloster.
2 CONT
