2 CONT * Letter from the Askan (1996); Hildebrand, aa; KH Karlsson, The Swedish King's Judgment ... during the Middle Ages (1890), p 42; its, aa 1906, s 30 f; 
2 CONT * K Kumlien, Västerås wool beginning of the 17th century (1971); Lags o doms; J Liedgren, aa, s 23; Löfqvist, aa, pp. 247 and 259; PA Munch. 
2 CONT * The History of the Norwegian People, 2: 1-2 (1862-63); S Rahmqvist, aa; its, the Sandbro family (PHT 1978); RPB; Schlegel, aa, s 15 ff o III ff; L Sjöstedt, 
