1 NOTE Utomäktenskaplig dotter (Elgenstierna:Svenska adelns ättart.Åtskilliga oäkta barn till hertigarna av huset Vasa adlades under namnet Gyllenhjelm. Hertig Johan den blivande Johan III, hade tre sådana av vilka dottern Sophia Gyllenh
2 CONC jelm blev gift med Pontus de la Gardie och därmed stammoder till hela ätten De la Gardie i Sverige.Svensk Historia, Alf Henrikson s. 927
1 NOTE KING OF SWEDEN
1 NOTE John became duke of Finland in 1556. His elder brother, Eric XIV, plotted 
2 CONT to have him condemned to death and imprisoned him from 1563 to 1567 on 
2 CONT suspicion that John was conspiring to restore a Roman Catholic monarchy to 
2 CONT Sweden. In 1568, with his younger brother Charles, later Charles IX, John 
2 CONT conspired against Eric and was elected king. Eric died of poisoning in 
2 CONT 1577, a deed probably instigated by John. Converted to Roman Catholicism 
2 CONT in 1578, John attempted to impose that religion upon his people but soon 
2 CONT abandoned the effort. Meanwhile, in alliance with the Poles, he warred 
2 CONT against Russia, which was compelled in 1583 to cede parts of Estonia to 
2 CONT Sweden.
