2 CONT
2 CONT * 1513/1514 	[http://matrikel.uni-rostock.de/id/100013099?_searcher=5d96b0b0-3882-43a4-a2e9-3ec5a3aaa539&_hit=3 8]  	Petrus 	Fremminck [Fleming] 	Swecus [Schweden] 
2 CONT * 1514/1515 Phil. 	[http://matrikel.uni-rostock.de/id/400060819?_searcher=5d96b0b0-3882-43a4-a2e9-3ec5a3aaa539&_hit=4 10]  	Petrus 	Fleminck [Fleming] 	Promotion zum Bakkalar 
2 CONT
