2 CONC sh in Åkers district and 1 land land in Vävelsta in Husby-Oppunda parish and a mill in Djupvik with two villagers in (Ö.) Husby (now in Kvarsebo) parish in Östkinds district. If they have children, the morning gift should be count
2 CONC ed as the children's mothers. If Sigrid dies (childless) before Holmger, the morning present returns to him. If Holmger dies first, the morning present will be Sigrids. Advice has been obtained from Mr. Magnus Torkelsson and Haral
2 CONC d Ernilsson and Karl Tuveson. - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/7574.pdf
