2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Benedictus+Canuti&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=2&postid=sdhk_27966&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 27966''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1462 May 28'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Västerås''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Electoral decree, whereby the chapter in Västerås elected Birger Månsson as bishop since the representative Benedict Canuti died 9/5 s.å. without having had time to be initiated.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Literature and Commentary:'''  original lost; exploited by Messenius J. Liedgren, "Västerå's medieval episcopal length", Studies in older history dedicated to Herman Schück 5/4 1985, p. 117 (with incorrect year); cf its. in V
2 CONC HAA's yearbook 1971, p. 223. See art subscriptio in KL XVII (1972), sp. 405.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Benedictus+Canuti&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_40190&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''SDHK no: 40190''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1462 January 14'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note that the papal treasurer Gilifortes de Buoncontibus received 125 gold florins in the commune servitium through the merchant house de Medicis from Benedictus Canuti, electus of Västerås, which the depositary of the chamber 
2 CONC Ambrosius de Spanochiis received.'''
2 CONT
