1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jens Pedersson=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Peder (Per) Jensson Dahlepil till Ström and Elin Esbjörnsdotter till Ström
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Dahlepil_nr_663 Noble family Dahlepil no. 663, Ennobled (in Denmark) 1506. Introd. 1660. Extinct 1815-04-29]
2 CONT
2 CONT Noble family Dahlepil no. 663 †, Ennobled (in Denmark) 1506. Introd. 1660. Extinct 1815-04-29. At the introduction of the family in 1660, the brothers Lennart and Anders Dahlepil had their representative Anders Lennartsson Svenske
2 CONC  "present their shield letters, which are also ad acta in original by King Christian and King Friderich in Denmark given". These letters are still among the appendices to the protocol of knighthood and nobility for the aforementio
2 CONC ned year and consist of a letter of exemption issued by King Christian II as heir to the throne from Bohus on 30 Nov. 1506 for one Anders Svendssen, who received as his weapon two white crossed valley arrows in a red field and a d
2 CONC rawn sword on his helmet, as well as King Fredrik I's letter of confirmation from around 1524. The family probably originates from this Anders Svendssen, although the lineage between him and the Peder Jensen below is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 1'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Peder Jensen, to Ström in Hjärtum parish, Gothenburg and Bohus counties''', which property he exchanged to Tormod Mattsson Stråle. After him and his wife, a succession was made in 1618. '''Married to Elin Esbjörnsdotter , to Rö
2 CONC storp in Västerlanda parish,''' Gothenburg and Bohus counties, daughter of Esbjörn Andersson to Ström.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''':
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Jens Pedersson, to Röstorp and Ström,''' which later property after a trial was awarded to him in 1613 after Stråle's widow Anna Pedersdotter Månesköld. Lieutenant Colonel. '''Married Anna Pedersdotter 2 , daughter of Peder B
2 CONC engtsson (Svenske) and Margareta Kagg .''' She lived as a widow Högen
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Lennart Dahlepil. Major.''' (son of Jens Pedersson, Tab. 1), til l Röstorp. Major. Was introduced along with his brother. 1660-11-24 under no. 663. '''Married to Elin Lilliebielke , daughter of Henrik Jönsson Lilliebielke, no
2 CONC . 273, and Elin Hierta .'''
2 CONT * Anders Dahlepil. son of Jens Pedersson, Tab. 1). Lived at Röstorp in 1660 2 . Introd. together with his brother s. year 24/11 under no. 663.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1 Danish pergonal hist. Journal. 2 CASE. 3 KrAB. 4 Pt IV p. 123. 5 Kp. 6 Lk. 7 At (S).
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36
