1 NAME Johan /Hjort af Ornäs/ 226 938
2 GIVN Johan
2 SURN Hjort af Ornäs
2 NSFX 226 938
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1445
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Denmark
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1476
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stråtenbo, Aspeboda
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Bergsman i Stråtenbo, Dansk frälseman
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Johan Hjort af Ornäs, bergsman=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth:	circa 1445 in Denmark
2 CONT * Death:	circa 1476 in Stråtenbo, Aspeboda Sweden.
2 CONT * Johan in Stråtenbo in present Aspeboda sn (Copp.), mentioned 1478-87, sold 1487 10/2 with his wife's consent Knutshyttan in St. Tuna sn, gm Birgitta Jönsdotter, daughter of the mountain bailiff Jöns Ingemarsson (two antlers).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Barbro Johansdotter ,''' former mountain man Per Sjurdsson in Främby in St. Kopparbergs sn, mentioned 1528-42, died before 1545 31/5, progenitor of adl. the Svinhufvud family of Qvalstad .
2 CONT * '''Ingemar Johansson''' (overview table 1), in Grundeboda. Seals letter 1515-03-01. Was district chief in 1528 and 1529. Sat on the committee at the Stora Kopparberget 1545-04-14. Carried two stag's horns in his coat of arms. [ 
2 CONC 1 ] Married to NN Persdotter, daughter of the miner Peder Olsson in Rankhyttan in Vika sn and Margareta Olsdotter (star, see noble family Stiernhielm ).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children of Ingemar Johansson=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Barbro Ingemarsdotter ,''' b. 1st m. Valerian Tradzen in Ornäs i Torsångs sn and Rankhyttan in Vika sn, mentioned 1577, married 2nd in 1591 m. Johan Lukasson in Ornäs i Torsångs sn, mentioned 1591.
2 CONT * '''Jöns Ingemarsson , to Ornäs''' in Torsång parish, Kopparberg county. Bailiff of St. Erik's Landbor 1530-10-31–1531 2 . Occurs in rust service lengths 1537 and 1563 3 . Bailiff of Näsgård county in Dalarne 1554–1556 2 . Sealed
2 CONC  among the nobility King Gustaf I's will 1560-06-30 and the estates' grant 1561-04-15. Member of King Erik's committee 1563–1567 4 . Signed the nobility's pledge of allegiance to King Erik 5 1569-01-26. Lived 5 1586-11-04. His sea
2 CONC l, in which two deer horns can be seen, can be found under several judgments and documents in Gagnet's parish chest. Married to his cousin Carin Arentsdotter, with whom he got a share in the old Svinhufvudska estate Ornäs, daughte
2 CONC r of Arent Pehrsson ( Örnflycht ) and Barbro Stigsdotter of the Svarta Svinhufvudsläkten. ( his mother-in-law Barbro Stig's daughter's family name "Svarta Svinhufvudsläkten" is misleading, because her father Stig Hansson (Djäkn) d
2 CONC id not belong to any pig's head family and carried three gilded roses in the coat of arms (not a pig's head).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Hiort_af_Orn%C3%A4s_nr_2012
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dansk frälseman. Bodde i Stråtenbo
2 CONT
2 CONT * Enl: Rickard Grusell:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Johan Hiort af Ornäs. Född omkring 1445.Johan i Stråtenbo, Aspeboda sn. Nämns då som "Johan i Stråtenbo"
2 CONT Äldste kände Stamfader til "Hiort af Ornäs". Han näms i livet 1478–1487. Eventuellt kom han från Danmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Familj med Britta Jönsdotter Vigsel 1470. Barn: XIV:486,XIV:8678 Barbro Johansdotter (Hiort af Ornäs). Jönsson Hjort av Ornäs.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Fran Gamla Världen till Nya": 203690. (HJÖRT), Johan of Stråtenbo, b. ca 1445 of Danish ancestry; lived at Stråtenbo, Aspeboda Parish, Kopparberg, ancestor to the Swedish noble family Hjort of Örnas; m. (4, 48, 50)
2 CONT
2 CONT *  1) Rickard Grusell
2 CONT
