2 CONT * '''Jöns Persson, i Risholn (Halv älg)''' Birth:	circa 1495 inRisholn, Leksand, Dalarna County, Sweden. Death: 1564 in Risholn, Leksand, Dalarna County, Sweden. Married Britta Roos Fran Blomberg and Margareta Hansdotter Svinhufvu
