1 NOTE {geni:about_me} On the 12 June 1655 Kettil Bollja was appointed Captain at Magnus Gabriel De la Gardie's Cavalry Regiment.  De la Gardie was commanding the Livonian Army a force of about 7000 men. Kettil had been billeted in Gloga
2 CONC u during the 1640's and 1650's.  In 1647 he married in Glogau to Sophia Brandt-Moller of a distinguished noble family in Silesia.  Sophia never lived in Sweden the only time she is known to have visted the parish of Vange and the 
2 CONC estate of Brunna was at her mother in law's funeral in around 1650.  At the death of Kettil and Sophia Brandt-Moller Bollja (of the Plague) in Riga, Kettil\s brothers the cavalry captains Johan and Claes Bollja took charge of the 
2 CONC daughter Anna and she was taken back to Brunna, Vange, by her uncles.  Claes died in 1665 and it seems Claes wife Ingridh Andersdotter became Anna;s guardian.
