2 CONT His father, Antonio de Palma, belonged to the court of Bona Sforza of Milano, Italy and followed her to Poland when she became the second wife of King Sigismund I of Poland in 1518. He also belonged to her daughter's Catherine Jag
2 CONC iellon of Poland's entourage to Finland after marrying Duke John of Finland (the future King John III of Sweden) in 1562.
2 CONT
