2 CONT * '''Bengta Månsdotter,''' Married to the underling and war colonel Peder Nilsson , knighted Gyllenstråle (no. 256), who lived in 1587.
2 CONT * '''Anders Månsson,''' died young.
2 CONT * '''Ingel Månsson,''' died young.
2 CONT * '''Gregorius Månsson,''' died young.
2 CONT * '''Margareta Månsdotter,''' died young.
2 CONT * '''Brita Månsdotter,''' '''died 1614-07-24 and buried in Falu church. Married 1st to Daniel Torkilsson ( ennobled Svinhufvud ), who lived in 1581, in his 2nd marriage. Married 2nd after 1595, but before (SK.) 1601-01-20 to the r
2 CONC ich mountain man Christoffer Olsson , knighted Gyllenknoster 1621-01-30, but not introduced, in Nor, in his 2nd marriage.'''
2 CONT * '''Bryngel Månsson,''' Bailiff at Västerås Castle 1597 (1597-02-09)–1602 (Al.). According to royal letter 1594-05-04, he had in fief a church home in St. Ilian's parish, Västmanland County, which he used himself in 1599. (Al.)
