2 CONC  by him into one and the same person. The two knights Magnus Nilsson (+ st. sk.) and Magnus Nilsson (post) are also confused by him. The Bonde family genealogy has also misunderstood by him. Rasmus Luduigsson's reputation and repu
2 CONC tation are genealogical researchers grew more and more, and towards the end of the 1500s can he be regarded as a kind of national genealogist. There had too came into vogue, after the German example, to expose the gravestones corr
